<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets $300 million seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets $300 million seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    25.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.376    PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    99.376    SPREAD	+52 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.50 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAY.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
